  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed validate compatibility and check: each app is now compiled against the Microsoft symbols of its minimum supported release, as AppSource validates, so APIs that are missing or internal there no longer pass locally. Understated application/platform minimums are reported as warnings; check always runs the compatibility step for baseline apps.\n      Added failure reasons to the validate compatibility and check summaries, and validate compatibility --bc-version minimum to name the minimum-release lane explicitly.\n      CHANGELOG.md contains the complete details.",
